 six-year metrics table (in Rs. Cr) shows a \"Free Cash\" line of 21.08 (FY21), 62.15 (FY22), 59.64 (FY23), 68.54 (FY24), 82.29 (FY25) and 96.17 (FY26); the accompanying chart is titled \"Free Cash Growth (356%)\".\n- The deck states that \"PropEquity's other income is the Interest Earned on Fixed Deposits and Dividends which will continue for the foreseeable future\", indicating a cash/fixed-deposit-heavy balance sheet.","src":"deck","as_of":"05-08-2026"},"other":{"title":"Notable from the deck","body":"- [Subsidiary] PropEdge is disclosed as \"(Our Subsidiary)\", reported on a standalone basis for Valuation and Professional services alongside standalone PropEquity and a consolidated view.\n- [Listing] The company is listed on NSE under the symbol PROPEQUITY and the deck references its IPO in April 2022.\n- [Leadership] Samir Jasuja is named as MD & CEO (Managing Director, DIN 01681776).","src":"deck","as_of":"05-08-2026"}}}